{"parse":{"title":"个性/以刃为誓","pageid":8481,"revid":21084,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%83%E4%B8%BA%E8%AA%93&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%83%E4%B8%BA%E8%AA%93&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%83%E4%B8%BA%E8%AA%93&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>以刃为誓</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.BB.A5.E5.88.83.E4.B8.BA.E8.AA.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"以刃为誓\"><b>以刃为誓</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 以刃为誓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/edz9se1rkvf1c9r9b64yu8rkx86k4an.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%83%E4%B8%BA%E8%AA%93.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/edz9se1rkvf1c9r9b64yu8rkx86k4an.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E4%BB%A5%E5%88%83%E4%B8%BA%E8%AA%93.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/19/edz9se1rkvf1c9r9b64yu8rkx86k4an.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />以刃为誓\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响，可翻越友军、敌人、中立角色、物品。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护•寒境\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护•寒境</font></span></span>]效果。拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">凛冬极星</font></span>]。<br />✦攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"刀刃伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">刀刃伤口</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]，同时可以格挡魔法攻击和范围攻击，<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>概率触发格挡。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>；行动开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锋芒</font></span></span>]。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"格挡\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">格挡</font></span></span>]时，若自身拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"敛锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">敛锋</font></span></span>]且攻击者位于范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内，则格挡效果变为受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。<br />✦攻击受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"刀刃伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">刀刃伤口</font></span></span>]的目标时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%8A%A0%E5%A1%94%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿加塔•凛冬极星\"><img alt=\"头像 阿加塔•凛冬极星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/6uwrip42fpim5p1wbon2zaut4c4ot5q.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿加塔•凛冬极星</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/i